@MinimalClean_HostAddress = http://localhost:57379

@MinimalClean_CartId = 68fe4cfd-84bb-4b8a-bb4e-528c26325c72

# Variables para Coupon: código nuevo, vencimiento futuro y GUID editables.
# Reemplazar Coupon_Id por el GUID real devuelto en Location tras Coupon 1.
@Coupon_Code = DEMOCOUPON_20261016
@Coupon_ExpirationUtc = 2035-12-31T23:59:59Z
@Coupon_Id = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@Coupon_MissingId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222

### List Products
GET {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Get Product By ID
GET {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Create Product
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Product",
  "unitPrice": 29.99
}

### Add to Cart (Anonymous User - creates cart)
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Add to Cart (Anonymous User - existing cart)
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "{{MinimalClean_CartId}}",
  "productId": 2,
  "quantity": 3
}

### View Cart
GET {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/cart/{{MinimalClean_CartId}}
Accept: application/json

### Checkout
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/cart/{{MinimalClean_CartId}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guest@example.com"
}
### Note: Get order ID from response for future use

### Coupon — Preparación manual
# Puerto 57379 verificado en Properties/launchSettings.json, perfil http.
# Usar un cliente .http con variables de archivo e interpolación, sin scripts.
# Los ejemplos son ilustrativos: no representan datos ya creados.
# Ejecutar individualmente; el POST válido persiste en la base configurada.
# Para otra demostración, elegir Coupon_Code nuevo (3-30 caracteres).
# Revisar Coupon_ExpirationUtc si deja de ser futura. No hay captura automática.

### Coupon 1 — POST válido: esperado 201 y Location
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "{{Coupon_Code}}",
  "discountPercentage": 12.345678,
  "expirationDate": "{{Coupon_ExpirationUtc}}"
}

### Coupon 2 — GET existente: esperado 200, requiere ejecutar Coupon 1
# Copiar SOLO el GUID de Location del POST en Coupon_Id, al inicio del archivo.
# El identificador inicial es ilustrativo; no garantiza un cupón existente.
GET {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons/{{Coupon_Id}}
Accept: application/json

### Coupon 3 — POST código vacío: esperado 400
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "",
  "discountPercentage": 12.345678,
  "expirationDate": "{{Coupon_ExpirationUtc}}"
}

### Coupon 4 — POST porcentaje 0: esperado 400
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "{{Coupon_Code}}",
  "discountPercentage": 0,
  "expirationDate": "{{Coupon_ExpirationUtc}}"
}

### Coupon 5 — POST porcentaje 101: esperado 400
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "{{Coupon_Code}}",
  "discountPercentage": 101,
  "expirationDate": "{{Coupon_ExpirationUtc}}"
}

### Coupon 6 — POST fecha pasada UTC: esperado 400
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "{{Coupon_Code}}",
  "discountPercentage": 12.345678,
  "expirationDate": "2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Coupon 7 — POST fecha sin UTC: esperado 400
# ISO 8601 sin Z ni offset: DateTimeKind.Unspecified; no es UTC.
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "{{Coupon_Code}}",
  "discountPercentage": 12.345678,
  "expirationDate": "2035-12-31T23:59:59"
}

### Coupon 8 — POST duplicado: esperado 409, requiere Coupon 1 exitoso
# Usar EXACTAMENTE Coupon_Code del primer POST, sin cambiar mayúsculas.
# Si no fue creado primero, esta solicitud puede crear el cupón con 201.
# Repetir Coupon 1 también devuelve 409 mientras el mismo código exista.
POST {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "{{Coupon_Code}}",
  "discountPercentage": 12.345678,
  "expirationDate": "{{Coupon_ExpirationUtc}}"
}

### Coupon 9 — GET inexistente: esperado 404 si Coupon_MissingId no existe
# GUID ilustrativo válido, distinto del GET existente. Cambiarlo si existe.
# No se comprueba automáticamente su ausencia en la base seleccionada.
GET {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons/{{Coupon_MissingId}}
Accept: application/json

### Coupon 10 — GET Guid.Empty: esperado 400, Problem Details
GET {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Coupon 11 — GET GUID mal formado: esperado 400, ErrorResponse de FastEndpoints
GET {{MinimalClean_HostAddress}}/Coupons/not-a-guid
Accept: application/json




